{"title":"1986 AHSME Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Simplify <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/7/f27c3f23f04eb150d43b50f763804f7a63e2affa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left(\\sqrt[6]{27} - \\sqrt{6 \\frac{3}{4} }\\right)^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"130\" height=\"56\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/8/818574ca432c1d777f4b480d79880260242e6d08.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\frac{3}{4} \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ \\frac{\\sqrt 3}{2} \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ \\frac{3\\sqrt 3}{4}\\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ \\frac{3}{2}\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\frac{3\\sqrt 3}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"431\" height=\"41\" />    \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/c/eecc8058dd5a4bbb12c47888360d8004ae0946e0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt[6]{27} = (3^{3})^{\\frac{1}{6}} = 3^{\\frac{1}{2}} = \\sqrt{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"192\" height=\"22\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/b/39ba386339c8f6b5518c9fe73377bbdade1dda97.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{6 \\frac{3}{4}} = \\sqrt{\\frac{27}{4}} = \\frac{3 \\sqrt{3}}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"164\" height=\"43\" />, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/1/3f1081e2e50da4d3c4dae68f666622275b69996a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\sqrt{3} - \\frac{3 \\sqrt{3}}{2})^{2} = (-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2})^{2} = \\frac{3}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"229\" height=\"41\" />, which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/e/f6eb65962292d994ce2f9a8af63728883f256b18.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{A}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"27\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME\" title=\"1986 AHSME\">1986 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1986 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1986 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1986\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1986 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1986 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems/Problem